  "flavor_text_entries": [
    {
      "flavor_text": "しっとの　エネルギーで　あいてを　こうげき。\nそのターン　のうりょくが　あがった　ポケモンを\nやけどの　じょうたいに　する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja-hrkt",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/1/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "질투의 에너지로 상대를 공격한다.\n그 턴에 능력이 올라간 포켓몬을\n화상 상태로 만든다.",
      "language": {
        "name": "ko",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/3/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "用嫉妒的能量攻擊對手。\n讓此回合內能力提高的\n寶可夢陷入灼傷狀態。",
      "language": {
        "name": "zh-hant",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/4/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Le lanceur attaque sa cible avec toute sa jalousie.\nCette capacité brûle tout Pokémon dont les stats\nont augmenté pendant ce tour.",
      "language": {
        "name": "fr",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/5/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Der Anwender greift mit der Energie seines Neids an\nund fügt allen gegnerischen Pokémon, deren Statuswerte\nin dieser Runde erhöht wurden, Verbrennungen zu.",
      "language": {
        "name": "de",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/6/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Ataca al objetivo con la energía generada por la envidia\ny causa quemaduras a los Pokémon cuyas características\nhayan aumentado en ese turno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "es",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/7/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "Chi la usa attacca con la forza dell’invidia, causando\nuna scottatura a tutti i Pokémon le cui statistiche sono\naumentate durante quel turno.",
      "language": {
        "name": "it",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/8/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "The user attacks with energy from jealousy. This leaves\nall opposing Pokémon that have had their stats boosted\nduring the turn with a burn.",
      "language": {
        "name": "en",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/9/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
      "flavor_text": "しっとの　エネルギーで　相手を　攻撃。\nそのターン　能力が　あがった　ポケモンを\nやけどの　状態に　する。",
      "language": {
        "name": "ja",
        "url": "/api/v2/language/11/"
      },
      "version_group": {
        "name": "sword-shield",
        "url": "/api/v2/version-group/20/"
      }
    },
    {
